  "instructions": [
    "Poach the cod fillets in simmering water at 180 degrees Fahrenheit for 8 minutes.",
    "Remove the cod from the water and let it cool to room temperature.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together lime juice, lemon juice, olive oil, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the sliced red onion, minced garlic, and grated ginger to the bowl and stir to combine.",
    "Flake the cooled cod into small pieces and add it to the bowl, stirring gently to combine.",
    "Cover the bowl with plastic wrap and refrigerate for at least 30 minutes to allow the flavors to meld.",
    "Just before serving, stir in the chopped cilantro.",
    "Serve the ceviche chilled, garnished with additional cilantro if desired."
  ],
